<strong>Privacy Policy</strong>

<p>
This privacy policy applies to the Chap app (hereby referred to as the "Application")
for mobile devices that was created by Nikolay Stoilov (hereby referred to as the
"Service Provider") as a service. This service is intended for use "AS IS".
</p>

<br>

<strong>Information Collection and Use</strong>

<p>
The Application does not require account creation or login.
The Service Provider does not collect personally identifiable information such as
your name, email address, or phone number through the Application.
</p>

<p>
When you use the Application, text, messages, or prompts you submit may be sent to
third-party AI model providers in order to generate translations or responses.
These requests are processed only for providing the functionality of the Application.
</p>

<p>
The Application may automatically collect limited technical information, including:
</p>

<ul>
  <li>Your device's Internet Protocol address (e.g. IP address)</li>
  <li>Device type and operating system version</li>
  <li>Crash logs and diagnostic information</li>
  <li>General usage statistics related to Application performance</li>
</ul>

<p>
The Application does not collect precise location information.
</p>

<br>

<strong>AI Processing</strong>

<p>
To provide its features, the Application sends user-submitted text to external AI
